# Weekly Client Updates

After completing any new feature, enhancement, or major bug fix, update `WEEKLY-CLIENT-UPDATES.md` in the workspace root.

- New entries go at the **TOP** of the file, below the header.
- Before ending any conversation that included qualifying work, verify this file was updated.
